<title>BAHRAIN: Britain's Prince Charles arrives in Bahrain.</title>
<headline>Britain's Prince Charles arrives in Bahrain.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Prince Charles arrived in Bahrain on Monday aboard the royal yacht Britannia, his official residence during a Gulf tour.</p>
<p>Prince Charles sailed from Kuwait on Saturday night aboard the 6,000-tonne Britannia, the 44-year-old floating residence of the British monarchy on its final voyage.</p>
<p>During his one-day visit, Prince Charles will inaugurate a British goods exhibition.</p>
<p>He is due to sail to Qatar on Monday night.</p>
</text>
